# Question 1
### Working with Amino Acid Properties

Given the following dictionary of amino acid properties, write loops to:
* Print only the amino acid names (keys)
* Print only the properties (values)
* Print each amino acid and its property in the format "Amino acid [name] is [property]"
<br>

# Question 2
### Finding High Expression Genes

Using this gene expression dictionary, write a loop that identifies and prints all genes with expression levels above 100.
<br></br>

# Question 3
### Filtering Protein Weights

Given a dictionary of protein molecular weights, write a loop that creates a new dictionary containing only proteins with molecular weights greater than 20.
<br></br>

# Question 4
### Working with Nested Protein Data

Work with this nested dictionary of protein information. Write a loop that prints each protein name and its function (ignore the weight).
<br></br>

# Question 5
### Comparing Metabolite Levels

Given two dictionaries of metabolite concentrations, write a loop that compares the values and prints which metabolites increased from morning to evening.
